      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "All valid points. I just want to mention for any newer players and for yourself that vrchat does have a separate particle limiter that requires you to setup in the config file. Yes they should really take everything from the config file and expose it in the new UI update but for now it is a available and has 100% saved my ass a few times in public worlds when users try to aim particle crashers at me.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-particle-system-limits",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
