  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-07T00:54:34.469Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We all hate malicious users and crashers, so I suddenly had the idea for a feature that adds a particle limit for avatars in public worlds, or possibly a check box for this setting when placing a portal. This would stop a**holes from coming into lobbies with the pure intention of ruining everyone's fun.\nIf you're about to complain about safety settings, then I'll complain that sometimes you leave people's particles shown and some malicious avatars still manage to crash me.",
